# MT5_COMMON_FILES is optional — leave it unset and the bridge resolves the
# folder itself from the running terminal (commondata_path\Files), falling back
# to %APPDATA%\MetaQuotes\Terminal\Common\Files. If you do set it, use a FULL
# ABSOLUTE path: %VAR% expansion is Windows-only (ntpath), so the value would
# be taken literally on any other platform.
